{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56568","headline":"火记歌（幷序） 十 · 韩蕴中","name":"火记歌（幷序） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月合天刚至，风生荠麦芽。\n土公亲祭祀，埏埴养金砂。\n桂影圆霄汉，曦和韵紫霞。\n鸿来玄鸟去，将见水中楂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩蕴中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56568.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56568","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}